    <selectionEntry id="tt26-heavy-regia" name="Heavy Regia Battleline Maniple" publicationId="tt26-retr-2026-pub" page="" hidden="false" collective="false" import="false" type="unit">
      <rules>
        <rule id="tt26-royal-court" name="Royal Court" publicationId="tt26-retr-2026-pub" page="" hidden="false">
          <description>The Warmaster/Iconoclast and the Warlord Titans within this maniple represent the King &amp; Queen, whose role it is to support each other in battle. Whilst the King &amp; Queen are within 12&quot; of each other, if one successfully gains an order, the other may be issued the same order without the need to pass a Command check.

The Warhound Titans are Courtiers whose role it is to shield the King &amp; Queen. Courtiers can merge void shields with the King &amp; Queen as if they were part of the same squadron. In addition, they may share shields with the King or Queen while within 3&quot; of them rather than only when in base contact.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
